Codex Work Quota Bar

This project is a macOS adaptation of:
https://github.com/Thinkdiff-lw/codex-quota-bar

Upstream version: v1.0.0
Upstream commit: 141b6ce6c45cf2acd44d8326414d2946e84a68ff

The upstream MIT license and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.
Changes include application and CLI path detection, dual quota display in the
menu bar and overlay, optional Accessibility-based following, pause behavior,
and documentation / packaging for the macOS adaptation.

This is an independent community adaptation. It is not an official OpenAI
product and is not the upstream author's original release binary.
